    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n13571" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">dĕ-unx</span></b> , uncis, m.
		uncia, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>eleven twelfths</i>, <i><span class="en">Varr. L. L. 5, § 172</span></i>
			Müll.: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">jugeri,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Col.
					5, 1, 12</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">heres ex deunce,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cic. Caecin. 6 <i>fin.</i></span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">avidi deunces,</span>”
				i. e. <i>eleven per cent</i>.,
				 <i><span class="en">Pers.
					5, 150</span></i>
			: potare deunces, i. e. <i>eleven measures</i>
			(cyathos), <i><span class="en">Mart. 12, 28</span></i>; cf. <i><span class="en">id. 6,
			78</span></i>.</div>
